{
  "id": "aisler-2025",
  "name": "AISLER design rules (all published stack-ups)",
  "short": "AISLER",
  "vendor": "AISLER",
  "kind": "fab-capability",
  "status": "verified",
  "source": "https://community.aisler.net/t/pcb-design-rules/41",
  "sources": ["https://community.aisler.net/t/2-layer-1-6-mm-35-m-hasl-design-rules/3735",
              "https://community.aisler.net/t/2-layer-1-6mm-35-m-enig-design-rules/3732",
              "https://community.aisler.net/t/2-layer-1-6mm-70-m-hasl-design-rules/5464",
              "https://community.aisler.net/t/2-layer-1-6mm-70-m-enig-design-rules/5465",
              "https://community.aisler.net/t/4-layer-35-m-enig-design-rules/3733",
              "https://community.aisler.net/t/6-layer-8-layer-and-more-35-m-enig-design-rules/5467"],
  "verified": "2026-11-21",
  "notes": [
    "Encodes all six rule sets on AISLER's design-rule index (checked 2026-11-21): 2L 35 um HASL, 2L 35 um ENIG and 4L 35 um ENIG (pages last updated 2025-07-07), 2L 70 um HASL and 2L 70 um ENIG (2025-12-04), 6L+ 35 um ENIG (2025-12-05).",
    "The stack-ups are alternatives, not a fineness ladder. They are listed 2 layers before 4 and 6, 35 um before 70 um, HASL before ENIG (assumed price order; AISLER's prices were not checked), and the engine picks the first one the board meets.",
    "AISLER treats plated holes up to 0.45 mm as vias and larger ones as component holes (minimum 0.5 mm, ring 300 um); the rules below follow that split.",
    "HASL via ring: 175 um is the absolute minimum, 200 um must be used wherever possible (the 70 um HASL table lists 200 um, its text 175 um).",
    "Castellated edges are not possible with HASL; ENIG stack-ups make them free of charge.",
    "Solder mask dam between pads is required on HASL boards and recommended on ENIG boards.",
    "6L+ covers 6, 8 and more layers; its page states no board thickness or inner copper, so neither is constrained here.",
    "Buried, blind, micro and tented vias, pressfit parts and user-defined subpanels are not supported.",
    "Silkscreen on pads is not supported; silkscreen-to-pad spacing 125 um; designs covering more than 25% of a side with silkscreen are rejected."
  ],
  "hole_basis": {"pth_offset": 0.0, "npth_offset": 0.0, "ring": "finished", "hole_clearance": "finished"},
  "dimensions": [
    {"id": "stackup", "label": "Stack-up", "choose": "cheapest", "monotonic": false, "levels": [
      {"id": "2L-35um-HASL", "aliases": ["2L-HASL", "2L"], "label": "2 layer, 1.6 mm, 35 um, HASL",
       "requires": {"finish": ["HASL", "HASL-LF", null]},
       "limits": {
        "layers_allowed": [2], "thickness_allowed": [1.6], "copper_max_um": 35,
        "track": 0.200, "gap": 0.150,
        "drill_plated": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.30, "note": "via (<= 0.45 mm)"}, {"value": 0.50, "note": "component hole (> 0.45 mm)"}],
        "ring": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.175, "note": "via ring: absolute minimum, use 200 um wherever possible"}, {"value": 0.300, "note": "component hole ring"}],
        "castellated": {"value": false, "note": "castellated edges are not possible with HASL; order 2L ENIG"},
        "mask_no_dam": {"value": false, "severity": "major", "note": "mask dam between pads is required for HASL"}
       }},
      {"id": "2L-35um-ENIG", "aliases": ["2L-ENIG", "2L-35-ENIG"], "label": "2 layer, 1.6 mm, 35 um, ENIG",
       "requires": {"finish": ["ENIG", null]},
       "limits": {
        "layers_allowed": [2], "thickness_allowed": [1.6], "copper_max_um": 35,
        "track": 0.125, "gap": 0.125,
        "drill_plated": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.25, "note": "via (<= 0.45 mm)"}, {"value": 0.50, "note": "component hole (> 0.45 mm)"}],
        "ring": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.100, "note": "via ring"}, {"value": 0.300, "note": "component hole ring"}]
       }},
      {"id": "2L-70um-HASL", "aliases": ["2L-70-HASL", "2L-HASL-70"], "label": "2 layer, 1.6 mm, 70 um, HASL",
       "requires": {"finish": ["HASL", "HASL-LF", null]},
       "limits": {
        "layers_allowed": [2], "thickness_allowed": [1.6], "copper_max_um": 70,
        "track": 0.225, "gap": 0.225, "smd_pad_min": 0.225,
        "drill_plated": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.30, "note": "via (<= 0.45 mm)"}, {"value": 0.50, "note": "component hole (> 0.45 mm)"}],
        "ring": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.175, "note": "via ring: absolute minimum, use 200 um wherever possible"}, {"value": 0.300, "note": "component hole ring"}],
        "castellated": {"value": false, "note": "castellated edges are not possible with HASL; order 2L 70 um ENIG"},
        "mask_no_dam": {"value": false, "severity": "major", "note": "mask dam between pads is required for HASL"}
       }},
      {"id": "2L-70um-ENIG", "aliases": ["2L-70-ENIG", "2L-ENIG-70"], "label": "2 layer, 1.6 mm, 70 um, ENIG",
       "requires": {"finish": ["ENIG", null]},
       "limits": {
        "layers_allowed": [2], "thickness_allowed": [1.6], "copper_max_um": 70,
        "track": 0.175, "gap": 0.175,
        "drill_plated": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.25, "note": "via (<= 0.45 mm)"}, {"value": 0.50, "note": "component hole (> 0.45 mm)"}],
        "ring": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.175, "note": "via ring"}, {"value": 0.300, "note": "component hole ring"}]
       }},
      {"id": "4L-35um-ENIG", "aliases": ["4L-ENIG", "4L"], "label": "4 layer, 0.8 or 1.6 mm, 35 um, ENIG",
       "requires": {"finish": ["ENIG", null]},
       "limits": {
        "layers_allowed": [4], "thickness_allowed": [0.8, 1.6], "copper_max_um": 35,
        "track": 0.125, "gap": 0.125,
        "drill_plated": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.25, "note": "via (<= 0.45 mm)"}, {"value": 0.50, "note": "component hole (> 0.45 mm)"}],
        "ring": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.100, "note": "via ring"}, {"value": 0.300, "note": "component hole ring"}]
       }},
      {"id": "6L-35um-ENIG", "aliases": ["6L+", "6L", "8L", "6L-ENIG"], "label": "6, 8 or more layers, 35 um, ENIG",
       "requires": {"finish": ["ENIG", null]},
       "limits": {
        "layers_min": {"value": 6, "note": "valid for 6, 8 and more layers"}, "copper_max_um": 35,
        "track": 0.100, "gap": 0.100,
        "drill_plated": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.20, "note": "via (<= 0.45 mm)"}, {"value": 0.50, "note": "component hole (> 0.45 mm)"}],
        "ring": [{"items": {"finished": {"max": 0.45}}, "value": 0.100, "note": "via ring"}, {"value": 0.300, "note": "component hole ring"}]
       }}
    ]}
  ],
  "always": {
    "smd_pad_min": 0.200,
    "drill_npth": 0.50,
    "drill_max": 5.6,
    "slot_plated": 0.70,
    "slot_npth": {"value": 0.80, "note": "slots under 1.8 mm are nibbled; 1.8 mm and wider are milled and preferred"},
    "hole_to_hole": 0.300,
    "hole_to_copper_npth": [{"items": {"slot": true}, "value": 0.300, "note": "NPTH slot to copper"}, {"value": 0.250}],
    "copper_to_edge": 0.300,
    "mask_web": 0.100,
    "silk_line": 0.150,
    "silk_text_height": 0.800,
    "silk_to_pad": {"value": 0.125, "note": "silkscreen on pads is not supported"},
    "board_size_min": 10,
    "board_size_max": 500,
    "blind_vias": false,
    "microvias": false
  },
  "tests": [
    {"name": "2-layer HASL board", "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 35, "track_outer": 0.25, "gap_outer": 0.2,
      "drill_via": [{"value": 0.3, "finished": 0.3}], "ring_via_outer": [{"value": 0.2, "finished": 0.3}], "drill_pth": [{"value": 0.8, "finished": 0.8}], "ring_pth_outer": [{"value": 0.35, "finished": 0.8}]},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-35um-HASL", "fits": true}},
    {"name": "0.13 mm gap on 2 layers needs 2L ENIG", "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "gap_outer": 0.13},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-35um-ENIG"}},
    {"name": "2-layer ENIG board", "context": {"finish": "ENIG"}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "track_outer": 0.25},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-35um-ENIG"}},
    {"name": "2L ENIG limits: 0.125 mm gap, 0.25 mm via, 100 um via ring", "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 35, "gap_outer": 0.125,
      "drill_via": [{"value": 0.25, "finished": 0.25}], "ring_via_outer": [{"value": 0.1, "finished": 0.25}]},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-35um-ENIG", "fits": true}},
    {"name": "0.12 mm gap on 2 layers has no AISLER stack-up", "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 35, "gap_outer": 0.12},
     "expect": {"required": null}},
    {"name": "castellations push a 2-layer board to ENIG", "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 35, "track_outer": 0.25, "castellated": 4},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-35um-ENIG"}},
    {"name": "castellations on a HASL board have no fit", "context": {"finish": "HASL"}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 35, "castellated": 4},
     "expect": {"required": null}},
    {"name": "70 um copper with 0.25 mm features needs 2L 70 um HASL", "context": {"copper_um": 70}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 70,
      "track_outer": 0.25, "gap_outer": 0.25, "smd_pad_min": 0.3, "drill_via": [{"value": 0.3, "finished": 0.3}], "ring_via_outer": [{"value": 0.2, "finished": 0.3}]},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-70um-HASL", "fits": true}},
    {"name": "70 um copper with 0.2 mm gaps needs 2L 70 um ENIG", "context": {"copper_um": 70}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 70,
      "track_outer": 0.25, "gap_outer": 0.2},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-70um-ENIG"}},
    {"name": "70 um copper with castellations needs 2L 70 um ENIG", "context": {"copper_um": 70}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 70,
      "track_outer": 0.25, "gap_outer": 0.25, "castellated": 2},
     "expect": {"required": "2L-70um-ENIG"}},
    {"name": "70 um copper with 0.15 mm gaps has no fit", "context": {"copper_um": 70}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 70, "gap_outer": 0.15},
     "expect": {"required": null}},
    {"name": "SMD pad 0.21 mm fails 70 um HASL", "context": {"copper_um": 70}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 70, "smd_pad_min": 0.21},
     "expect": {"target": "2L-70-HASL", "ok": false, "violations": ["smd_pad_min"]}},
    {"name": "4-layer ENIG board", "context": {"layers": 4, "finish": "ENIG"}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 4, "layers_min": 4, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "track_outer": 0.13, "gap_outer": 0.13,
      "drill_via": [{"value": 0.25, "finished": 0.25}], "ring_via_outer": [{"value": 0.1, "finished": 0.25}]},
     "expect": {"required": "4L-35um-ENIG"}},
    {"name": "4-layer board with 0.11 mm gaps has no fit", "context": {"layers": 4}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 4, "layers_min": 4, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 35, "gap_outer": 0.11},
     "expect": {"required": null}},
    {"name": "6-layer board with 0.1 mm gaps", "context": {"layers": 6, "thickness_mm": 1.6}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 6, "layers_min": 6, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "copper_max_um": 35,
      "track_outer": 0.1, "gap_outer": 0.1, "gap_inner": 0.1, "drill_via": [{"value": 0.2, "finished": 0.2}], "ring_via_outer": [{"value": 0.1, "finished": 0.2}]},
     "expect": {"required": "6L-35um-ENIG", "fits": true}},
    {"name": "8-layer 2.0 mm board fits 6L+", "context": {"layers": 8, "thickness_mm": 2.0}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 8, "layers_min": 8, "thickness_allowed": 2.0, "copper_max_um": 35, "gap_outer": 0.15},
     "expect": {"required": "6L-35um-ENIG"}},
    {"name": "0.15 mm via drill fails 6L+", "context": {"layers": 6}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 6, "layers_min": 6, "drill_via": [{"value": 0.15, "finished": 0.15}]},
     "expect": {"target": "6L+", "ok": false, "violations": ["drill_via"]}},
    {"name": "4-layer board ordered as 6L+", "context": {"layers": 4}, "measured": {"layers_allowed": 4, "layers_min": 4},
     "expect": {"target": "6L", "ok": false, "violations": ["layers_min"]}},
    {"name": "via ring 150 um on 2L HASL", "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "ring_via_outer": [{"value": 0.15, "finished": 0.3}]},
     "expect": {"target": "2L-HASL", "ok": false, "violations": ["ring_via_outer"]}},
    {"name": "0.48 mm plated hole is a component hole", "measured": {"layers_allowed": 2, "layers_min": 2, "thickness_allowed": 1.6, "drill_pth": [{"value": 0.48, "finished": 0.48}]},
     "expect": {"target": "2L", "ok": false, "violations": ["drill_pth"]}}
  ]
}
